  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [metalsmith-layouts](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts) from `v1.8.1` to `v2.1.0`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v2.0.0`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/releases/2.0.0)\n\n* moved to jstransformers (and dropped consolidate)\n* breaking: dropped node 0.12 and node 4 support\n* breaking: removed options:\n  * `engine`: inferred automatically from the layout extension by jstransformer\n  * `partials`: use metalsmith-register-partials instead\n  * `partialExtension`: no longer necessary\n  * `rename`: use metalsmith-rename instead\n  * `exposeConsolidate`: no longer necessary\n\n---\n\n### [`v2.1.0`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/releases/2.1.0)\n\n* add a documentation link to the error messages\n* add debug for better debugging\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v2.0.0\n-   [`7b8bd9b`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/7b8bd9b3e190c738c8c9bbb5dc20c1565698d68a) Add custom error message to include file path (#&#8203;130)\n-   [`5f83be3`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/5f83be33f04972521a9693d7a747e69eca0698ed) Update after move (#&#8203;136)\n-   [`4ddd399`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/4ddd3997f4ed76a9b27e9bcabaa12b39c8b3c000) v2 (#&#8203;132)\n-   [`0e434ac`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/0e434acfc3c68cb97476a0c13ed4a1de6ad99eea) Update dependencies to enable Greenkeeper 🌴 (#&#8203;135)\n-   [`1c547d9`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/1c547d98fae1c9d652a988b9ee6e1d73c1a59272) Prepare 2.0.0 (#&#8203;140)\n#### v2.1.0\n-   [`8b8a3cc`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/8b8a3ccd5900598131183071b114c2040602ac56) Minor tooling updates (#&#8203;141)\n-   [`8be696d`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/8be696de5c542dc835964daed93895aa01dabef9) Add npmrc (#&#8203;143)\n-   [`299c834`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/299c834b82b47fd7e70c6502c932e4ccbc637f8b) Update readme (#&#8203;144)\n-   [`590429b`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/590429b6b25e6aa09343bd64cf7037bb62918971) Update other plugins (#&#8203;145)\n-   [`fe65697`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/fe6569762c1353d9705b592a905211167befbc9e) Add debug information (#&#8203;148)\n-   [`128b5ab`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-layouts/commit/128b5abf7b460505d4931aee58ff17b8575a42d9) Prepare 2.1.0 (#&#8203;149)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
